  "runtimeSupport": {
    "board": "lilygo-t5-e-paper-s3-pro",
    "status": "diagnostic",
    "scope": "接入 H752-01 的 ED047TC1 960×540 原始电子纸黑白驱动、PCA9535 数字控制线、BOOT、PCA9535 功能键与 SPI TF 卡。LCD_CAM 使用241×544字节流，校验真实数据线排列和 CKV 时钟，跳过每行前导字节及末尾4行。屏幕断电保留内容。TPS651851 电源芯片及其 power-good 未模拟且不会伪造成功，官方完整开机流程仍未验证；16级灰阶、GT911触摸、LoRa、GNSS和音频等未实现。",
    "unsupported": [
      "Official factory binary boot and physical hardware validation are unverified. Native authored Xtensa SRAM fixtures execute the documented peripheral MMIO.",
      "ED047TC1 is physically a 16-gray-capable raw panel. This model implements only the explicit two-bit black/white drive endpoint: symbols1/2 drive black/white,0/3 retain. Analog waveform integration, gray levels, ghosting, temperature and physical gate pulse calibration are unmodeled.",
      "The existing Et047tc1 helper is reused solely for independently confirmed two-bit drive semantics; metadata and identity remain ED047TC1, without asserting these are the same panel.",
      "Pixel data enters through routed LCD_CAM source/gate symbols, not a host supplied RGB framebuffer. The tested native guest scopes are digital rails/GPIO/I2C; raw display transfer goldens exercise the completed board callbacks, not an official factory binary.",
      "PCA9535 direction/output/input pair registers model only digital lines. OE8/PWRUP11/VCOM12/WAKEUP13 must be explicitly driven high. TPS power-good input14 remains low; TPS651851 I2C address0x68, charger/fuel gauge/RTC are absent, so no fabricated official power-on handshake.",
      "One completed RGB transfer requires a fresh STV falling edge, exact RGB241x544 bytes, DATA8..15 pin permutation and at least544 already-running CKV48 pulses. Modeled rows are540; each row prefix and padded bottom rows are ignored.",
      "Frontlight GPIO11 pulse/PWM optical behavior and audio/radio/GNSS are unmodeled."
    ],
    "firmwareCompatibility": "No factory image is claimed working by a board protocol test."
  },
